# `docs/` is NOT a build directory here -- it holds the normative mirror
# (`hpke-pq.md`) and the archived drafts it cites, all tracked. It was ignored
# wholesale, and the tracked files survived only because the subtree merge that
# added them predates the rule; any *new* file added there was silently
# dropped, which is how a doc gets written and never lands. Only the local
# research scratch is ignored now.
docs/untracked/

